===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gem-pro|*uhnaz}} (compare {{cog|nl|oven}}, {{cog|nds|Aven}}, {{cog|nds-de|[[Aven]], [[Awen]], [[Owen]]}}, {{cog|fy|ûne}}, {{cog|en|oven}}, {{cog|da|ovn}}, {{cog|sv|ugn}}, {{cog|is|ofn}}, {{cog|got|auhns|sc=Latn}}), probably from a {{der|de|ine-pro|*aukw-||cooking pot}}, {{m|ine-pro|*Hukʷ-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*ukwnos}} (compare {{cog|sa|उखा}}, {{cog|xcl|ակութ}}, {{cog|sq|anë}}, {{cog|la|aulla}}, {{m|la|olla}}, {{cog|grc|ἰπνός}}).

